        clues_discovered=["Corpse found dashed over the jagged crag, wearing Sir Henry's reddish-tweed suit", "Holmes turns the body over: It is Selden the convict, killed because the hound pursued Sir Henry's scent on the clothes", "Jack Stapleton appears out of the fog, shaken to find Holmes on the moor; Holmes conceals his knowledge"],
