        clues_discovered=["Thread 1 fails: Cartwright searched 23 hotel wastebaskets; found zero mutilated copies of The Times", "Thread 2 fails: Telegram to Barrymore at Baskerville Hall was delivered to his wife, proving nothing", "Thread 3 delivers a shock: Cabman John Clayton reveals his fare paid him two guineas and said “I am Sherlock Holmes!”", "Sir Henry’s old, scent-soaked black boot stolen from Northumberland Hotel, confirming predator now has the scent"],
