        clues_discovered=["Concealed the wig and clothing of the 1647 Hugo Baskerville portrait to reveal Jack Stapleton’s face", "Confirmed Stapleton is the legitimate son of Rodger Baskerville, claiming the direct succession", "Instructed Sir Henry to accept Stapleton’s dinner invitation and walk home alone across the moor", "Secretly met Inspector Lestrade at Coombe Tracey station with an arrest warrant"],
