        clues_discovered=["Rescued Beryl Stapleton bound and gagged to an upright post in the locked upstairs bedroom", "Beryl revealed Stapleton fled into the Great Grimpen Mire to his secret tin-mine island refuge", "Discovered Sir Henry’s stolen black boot dropped along the submerged stake pathway in the mire", "Stapleton missed the submerged path in the blinding fog and was swallowed alive by the bottomless quagmire"],
